[I] DuckDuckGo from the terminal

[T] ddgr is a command line utility to search DuckDuckGo from the terminal,
[T] similar to googler. It supports DuckDuckGo bangs, configurable numbers
[T] of results, regional search and opening results in a browser.

[U] https://github.com/jarun/ddgr

[A] Ddgr Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

